Reduce the conclusion to the remaining proof obligations. Fix the arbitrary inputs or assume the hypotheses. Establish an intermediate fact. Simplify using the standard rewrite rules. Rewrite the conclusion using the stated equalities.

Reduce the equality to equality of the corresponding arguments. Rewrite the conclusion using the stated equalities. Both sides reduce to the same expression. Rewrite the conclusion using the stated equalities. Reduce the equality to equality of the corresponding arguments.

Establish an intermediate fact. Fix the arbitrary inputs or assume the hypotheses. Establish an intermediate fact. Rewrite the conclusion using the stated equalities. Rewrite the conclusion using the stated equalities.

Simplify using the standard rewrite rules. Establish an intermediate fact. Fix the arbitrary inputs or assume the hypotheses. Apply the first step, then apply the next step to every resulting obligation. Simplify using the standard rewrite rules.

Move the embeddings inside the algebraic operations. Reduce the conclusion to the remaining proof obligations. Expand and normalize the polynomial expressions, which then agree. A detailed English derivation is pending.
